From d7f6b5866310f3eac90f99e103da750a57bfe02f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Florent Kermarrec <florent@enjoy-digital.fr>
Date: Tue, 16 Jun 2026 18:36:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] builder: add Bear compile database PoC

Add an optional --software-compile-commands Builder flag that wraps the existing LiteX software package builds with Bear to generate compile_commands.json.

The normal software build path is unchanged unless the option is requested. When enabled, the build requires Bear, forces the package make steps so compiler invocations are visible, appends entries across packages, and post-processes the generated database to normalize paths and remove duplicates.

Add Builder tests covering the command-line option, Bear invocation, dependency/error handling, and compile database post-processing.
